    "sections": {
        "description": "The ST Resume WordPress theme is an excellent choice for developers, UI/UX designers, programmers, and other professionals looking to create a visually impressive portfolio website. With its retina-ready design and modern functionality, this theme makes it simple to showcase your work, skills, and achievements in a professional manner. It includes a testimonial section, customizable banners, social media integration, and a wide range of personalization options to help you create a unique online presence. Perfect for job seekers and freelancers, ST Resume offers a clean, elegant, and polished design that helps make a strong first impression. The Elementor drag-and-drop page builder allows you to create pages, portfolios, project showcases, and blogs with ease—without requiring any coding knowledge. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly, the theme ensures a seamless browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Additional features include Google Fonts support, cross-browser compatibility, clean code, and widget-ready areas. Regardless of your profession, ST Resume provides a sleek and professional platform to showcase your expertise and stand out online. ST Resume WP Theme Demo Page: https://striviothemes.com/demo/st-resume-pro/"
    },
